Datatypes:
An attribute that specifies the type of data in a column of our database-table

Most common datatypes:
Numberic : int,double,float,decimal
String   : varchar
Date     : Date
Boolean   : Boolean


Constraint:
It is a rule applied to a column

Not null,default value,primary key,auto increment

create table person(id int primary key,name varchar(100) not null,city varchar(50) default 'lhr');
